<para>The data type to be exchanged.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>BLOCK_THREADS</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The thread block size in threads. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
